  "description": "Document-aware testing for PDF and Word files in .NET. Semantic snapshots, comparisons and checks built on what a document says (tag structure, text, alt text, reading order, tables, links, fonts, forms, styles and layout), not how the file is encoded. A failing test explains which element changed and on which page. Text and JSON snapshots use the same workflow.",
